# Path of the Beastmaster (jeuno 19): Brutus, the Chocobo and Osker in Upper Jeuno. Save My Son not completed (no
# section: Chocobo's Wounds' 22 at Brutus, its 61 at the chocobo), then completed (Save My Son's 55 at the chocobo), the
# offer 70 (the beastmaster job unlocked, YOU_CAN_NOW_BECOME_A_BEASTMASTER, completed: the Job Gesture: Beastmaster key
# item, Animal Trainer, fame +7 x3), then Brutus's 20, the chocobo's 72 and Osker's 45 (both replaceDefault).
# Brutus's script is silent here (Chocobo's Wounds completed, Wings of Gold not), so his Event actions show each time.
# A bone chip traded to Brutus while offered: no trade handler, nil.
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Chocobo/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Osker/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/70
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 lvl=30
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Brutus                  # Save My Son not completed: no section; Chocobo's Wounds' 22
finish
trigger Chocobo                 # Chocobo's Wounds' 61
finish
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed # a GM
trigger Chocobo                 # Save My Son's 55
finish
walk -55.5,8.2,97.5             # beside Brutus
trade Brutus BoneChip x1        # available: no trade handler, nil (his script has none)
trigger Brutus                  # available: 70
finish                          # BST unlocked, YOU_CAN_NOW_BECOME_A_BEASTMASTER, completed: Job Gesture KI, Animal Trainer, fame +7 x3
trigger Brutus                  # completed: 20
finish
trigger Chocobo                 # 72 (replaceDefault; Save My Son's 55 needs this quest not completed)
finish
trigger Osker                   # 45 (replaceDefault)
finish
